<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Qollasiyaasike Manni'a</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ergemallo Phawuloosixxa Erga Qollasiyaasike Manni'a</para>
  <para style="toc2">Qollasiyaasike Manni'a</para>
  <para style="toc3">Qol.</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ergemallo Phawuloosixxa Erga</para>
  <para style="mt1">Qollasiyaasike Manni'a</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Tinni erga borreesendeek eettene shiixxoxxe Issiya'ni Effesooninaa'n borroti darree'ni hedheeke Qollasiyaasike qachcha'ni hexxeexxe Mageniinxe tuuta'aatene: tinni Mageniinxi tuutanna ijaarendeek Pawuloosinite kadanna gophphoole Roomexxe galcha kaddeeke Issiyak lumo qachcha kaddeexxe Effesooninaa'n wengeeletika erganjuwwa isi bobbaase'eemmaxxee Qollasiyaasixxi yaanenna isoo uudda'emman; Qollasiyaasixxe Mageniinxe tuuta'n, «Mageno ege'nateenna wo'ma anjira alfatee mitti mitting manji hafuuruwwiinxe hunnuwwa'ninna baalluwwa'n sagada hassissaan» hiyyaak dharichchi barachchiisano hexxeexxa Pawuloosi laqeemman. Tinni barachchiisano hittta'eemaxxi wele yaane, «Mitti mitting manji jila ofo'latishsha hexxeexxa aaduwwa'a hiremanna itatixxanna wele yaanuwwaka seera heqqadha hassissaan» hitaaxxemman.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosi tennee erga borreesseek dhugaatixxe amanaxxa erga shiqisat insa'nexxa dhariinxa barachcho xaa'nateetemman; isi shiqiseeke hiisichchuwwinaa'n umo kadeek, «Iyyesuusi Kiristoosi wo'ma anjira uwwaan; tinni wele amanuwwanna hujuwwa kinni isinaa'ni bayyissaan» hiyyaaken. Mageni Kiristoosi darree'ni butta duuchcha dadeen; Isi darree'ni konneechchuwwa ifibaa iyyedagaan; butta duuchcha anjirematixxa adde affaaki Kiristoosii'i mitte godobinn amana callinniten. Konne qicinn Phawuloosi tinni jabaxxi barachcho amanyetixxe hedho giddo hitta hujete'n hossa dandeetaaxxa barrisa'neen.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tennee erga Phawuloosinaa'ni adhdhe Qollasiyaasi'a geessisatee ergemeeke Tikiqoosinni welti hedhemmak Anasimoosite kadeexxa uuda la'o affeexxen; Phawuloosi konne Anasimoosi hiyyemeeke garbichchixxee safeexxi Filimooni'a wele erga borreesse'een.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">E'yichchoo <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosika adabanna isixxa huje <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:9-2:19">1:9—2:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosinni haarooxxa hedho <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 2:20-4:6">2:20—4:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muuxamaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Fedhii Mageniinxenni Yessuusi Kiristoosike ergamallo kade'eeke Phawuloosinaa'ninna dayyo no'oke Ximotoosinaa'n <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />Qolasiyaasi hexxina'neeke Kiristoosinni mitteke kaddineexxe woyyole'anna xuurameessa amaanye dayyuwwi'a Mageno no'oke Anninaa'n badhaadhikinna nage'i ha'no'a kadowwaal!<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Qollasiyaasike Mannixxee Mageno Galateeffate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />No'o ha'nooxxee Mageno soodantanno wodda Gootta no'oke Yessuusi Kiristoosike anna kadeeka Mageno duuchchi wodda galateefantaannen. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Galateefantaannechchinna ha'no Yessuusi Kiristoosi'ni amanaxxeenna amanye duuchchi'a affineexxa jaalala laqeennexxeeten. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Tinninna kaddeechch iima ha'no'a qixxotte hexxemmaxxe addenaa'n kexxeexxeniten; tenne addexxeenna wengeeletika dhugaatika hiyyichcho edissine laqqineen. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />Tinni wengeelenna ha'noobaa gelte'een; tenne wengeelenna laqqineexxi Mageniinka badhaadha dhugaati qalbeefattineexxe barranaa'n butta duuchcha'n hujja'nemmashshanni ha'noo'ninna gumma gummissa'ninnaa nophphita'neen. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Tenneenna no'oxxee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mitte mitte oolmixxi tikaar ha'noo hitaan.</char></note> Kiristoosike xurameessa erganjo kadeek, no'onni welti ergatenshati abidme'eek iikki eeyyeemmalli Ephaafira konnee badhaadha ha'no'n barachchiise'een. <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />Isinna woyyichcha hafuurixxa eeyyunte affineexxa no'o'ni kuleen.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Tennexxe tenne lanqennexxe barranaa'ni Mageni ifixxe fedhiixxa ege'naa hafuuriinke beekkuminninna qalbeffachcho duuchchinni ha'no'n wonsho'a ha'nooxxee soodachchonna kadha uurrinsebe'non. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Iittanni Goottakee hassissaa qicinni hexxina'ninna, isoo wo'ma qico gammachchiissinaashshaten; tinninna duuchchiinxe eloxxe hujeenni gumma gummisinna'n Mageno ege'nati nophphitino'a soodantaannen. <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Gootti ifixxe lumoxxe hunnanni uduuda duuchcha ha'no'a uwwowwaal; ossatinna duuchchiinxa yaane dande'atee gammashshoti qixxesendineeke kaddineexxi hexxino'a ha'no geessisowwaal. <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />Ha'noonna ifiinxe moottumma giddo hedheeka qadaada Woyyooleti welti qoodendinaashsha ha'noo geessiseeka Mageno Aabii'i gammashshoti galateeffatte. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Mageni no'oo dukkanatixxe hunnanaa'ni fulcheexxi ookkone eeyyeemake ifike beltixxe mootumma'ni e'yinannoshsha asse'eeni. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />Isixxe wodanninna no'oxxe cubboxxa gattowwaali alfineennen.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yessuus Siretike Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kiristoosi leellabaake Mageni'a dhugaatixxe fakken. Isi dada duuchchi edi darre angafaken. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Iimate'ninna buttate'n hedheechchiir, leellaachchiirinna leellabaachchiir, iimatixxi hunnuwwa, galchalluwwi, sooressuwwikinna baalloomiikiir duuchchi dademeeki isinniten. Iittanni Magen duuchchiinxa yaane dadedeek isinninna isi'aten. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Kiristoosi duuchchiinxe yaane edi darre hedhemman; duuchchiinxi yaane abidendeexxi uurriteek isinniten. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Isi biso ifike kadeexxe Mageniinxe tuutake umon; Isi duuchchiinxe yaane iimi darre hedheeke kado'a reyotenaa'n ke'ati siretikenna angafaken. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Tenninna kaddeechchi Magenummatixxi wo'ma iso'ni hexxo'a Mageno Aabixxe fedhii kaddeemmaxxeeten. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Fannote'ni hana dunendeexxe isike beltixxe mundenni nage'a iyyedage. Isi darree'n iimate'ninna buttate'n hexxeexxi yaane duuchchi ifi'ni araarendaashsha asse.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Edi wodda Magenokenaa'ni bayyattinne hexxinemmaan; ha'nook heduminna ha'nooxxe fuggoxxe hujenni Magenokee naaphake kadineemman. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Ta'a kinni woyyoolenna luqqi hitine'eeke, ci'ma belonna hexxineeke asseexxi isi edo ha'noo shiqisho'a Kiristoosike maalixxe reyonni Mageni ifi'ni ha'noo araarse. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Tinninna kaddaak lele'mitinebaang ti'nii hitine uurrati tenne wengeelenni afendeexxe eettenne addenaa'n daaqinebaang ha'nooxxe amananni hexxinoole callanni; Tinni wengeelenna ha'no laqqineexxenna butta duuchcha'n, manji duuchchi'a lallabendeexxenni; ani Phawuloosinna erganjoke kade'eenek tenne wengeele'aanden.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosi Ergamalliinxa Ergatensha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Ta'a ha'noxxee adhdhannoxxe rakko'ni gammadaannen; Kiristoosike biso kaddeexxe Mageniinxe tuuta hiyyenexxi Kirsitoosi adhdha'naa gatteemmaxxa rakko anke maala'n wonshannon. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Mageniinka hiyyichcho ha'no'n wo'ma qicinni ifisonnaa ani'a Magenokenaa'n uwwendeexxe galchallumanni ani Mageniinxe tuutake erganjo kadeennen. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Kunni Mageniink hiyyichchi edi barro'n ila ila'n buqende turtemmaxxenna ta'a kinni Mageni amanaake duuchchi'a ifiseexxe buqo yaane. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Magenikinna ha'no Ayihuudake kadinebaake mannixxe oddo'n tennee buqo yaanexxi ulfinnixxi durumma hitteexxe kaddeexxa ege'nisho'a eeyye; tinni buqo yaanenna ulfinnixxe adde kade'eeke, ha'no giddo hedheeke Kiristoosin. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />No'onna mitte mittenga manjo Kiristoosi'ni wo'ma manjo assine shiqinsonnaa manjo duuchcha beekkumik gorsina'ninna barachchiisa'n isoo lallanbaannen. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Mageni jabaxxe ifixxe lummoxxe hunnanni ani giddo hujammaxxee tenne hunnanni tinni yaane muuxendo'a jaba qicinni fiiddi hiyya'n cichchaannen.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Ha'nooxxeenna Lodoqiyake qachcha'n hedheeke mannixxee, iittanni ille anxa uuddeexxi ege'nebaake manni duuchchixxee hitta jaba qicinni cichcha'n hedhennexxa egendino'a eeyyaannen. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Iittanni qalbe insa'ne dayyaatee'naa jaalallati weli weli abidemmaashsha, wo'ma kaddeexxa qalbeefachchotixxa durumma alfineexxi Mageniinxa buqo yaane kade'eeka Kiristoosii'i egenno'a si'aannen. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Beekkumiinxinna ege'natixxi karra duuchchi sho'onde hexxeeki Kiristoosi'niteni.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Tenne hiyyaannechchi fedheekinna eloke laba'ni dhariinke haaso'inni ha'noo sobabaashshaten. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Fedhee qico midde manjunteti ha'nobaa'ni bayyatennexxxe kaddoolenna hafuurik kinni ha'noonni welti hedhenneni; elo qico seerik hexxineexxenna Kiristoosi'ni affinneexxa jabaxxa amana uuda'n gammadaannen.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosinn Afendaaxxa Wo'ma Hedho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Yoona Gootta Yessuusi Kiristoosi'i adhdhitineemma qicinn iso'ni hedhdhee! <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Iso'ni hidda oltitineexxi iso'ni ijaaremme; baratinemma qicinni amana ha'nooxxenni jabaatine'e wo'me danbala'aaka galata shiqishinna'n hedhdhe.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Kiristoosi hana kaddebaak manji fulcheexxi aadda'ninna tenne butta'n moyeeke hafuuruwwi hanna ijaaremeeke, kaba buttixxe yaane'a hunna afeeke beekumininna tooliinxenna yaanenni ayyinna ha'noo dedhinseexxi foxoorabaashsha heqqedhdhe! <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Magenummatixxi wo'munte duuchcha bisoke'n leellite hexxaak Kiristoosi'niten. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />Ha'noonna wo'ma hedho alfitineek galchatikenna baalloomi duuchchike umo kadeeki Kiristoosiniten.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Iso'ni amanat jila ofoldine'een; tinni ha'nooxxi jila ofo'laa cubbichcha maaliinka adaba fuggussatee Kiristoosinni assendeexxe malee manjiinxe anga'ni assendeexxebaan. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Xammaqendinee wodda Kiristoosinni welti moogendineen; Kirsitoosinni welti reyotenaa'ninna kexxineen; ha'no reyotenaa'n kexxineek Kirsitoosii reyotenaa'ni ke'issiteexxe Mageniinxe hunna'ni amanatiten. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Ha'noo ha'noxxe balleessaninna ha'nooke maalika cubbaaleessumatika adaba jila ofo'la gophati rertineemman; ta'a kinni Mageni Kiristoosinni ha'noo hedhotike asse'een; no'oxxa cubbo duuchchanna ha'no'a gattowwaali hiyyeen. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Isi no'o ku'lta'ninna xaa'nita'n hexxemmaxxa hidiinxa borro iseke seeruwwininni balleesse; fannoti hananna fannisemeexxi isee no'onaa'n fuggusse. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Sooreessuwwakanna baalloomuwwiinxa baalle mulqat fanniseme injifateexxi booji'emeeke kada insa'nexxi duuchiinge'n leellitaashsha asse insa'nee marensiise.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Tennexxee itatixxenna ha'watixxe, yookaani ayyaaiinxe, yookaani agenji fulaaxxa barra heqqedhatixxe, yookaani Edi Sanbata ulfeessatixxe buutto'a, ayyinna ha'noo'ni murte muroqqe'e! <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Tinni yaane duuchcha edi'a daggaaxxee yaanexxe gaaddiddoten; gaaddiddo iittinna lellishshaak Kiristoositen. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Sobiinxe shaqunteninna erganni magenoonfatta eeyyaak ayyinna ha'noo tola gatisabaashsha heqedhdhe; iitta hedheek manji uudeexxe waleellaxxee'e ifi saada'n woyi fulabaake maaliinke heduminni wo'meexxi ifi dukaan. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Kunni manji, bisiinke umo kadeeke Kiristoosinni welti mittumma afeekebaan; biso duuchcha mikitikinna hiddik mitteba abidiseexxi, la'isaak umoken; Mageni biso duuchcha nossaake konne qicinniten.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhariinxe Barachchonaa'n Ifi Heqqedhaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Kiristoosinni welti rertineexxi tenne butta'n moyeeke hafuuruwwinaa'n gargarti higgineechchinni kayyi'a mayyeeta ookkone ajajuwwi'a hirendina? <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />Iikki ajajuwwinna «Abidoxxe, afo'ik maqqoxxe'e, tuqqoxxe'e!» hiyyaakeeran. <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Ajajuwwi kunni manji giiseeke ajajuwwa'ninna manjiinxe barachcho'n ijaaremeeke kadeemmaxxee hujete'n hoseechchi uduma ba'o'a muremeeken. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Kunni ajajuwwi, ifixxe fedhiinni kaddeexxe magenoonfachcho'ninna sobiinxe shaqunte'n, manjuntetike biso miice abidatixxe yaane'n duudha'emmaxxee'e beekumma afeechcho labaan; yaane kinni maaliinxa gaabe abidatee mitte la'onna afebaakeeran.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosinn Afendaaxxa Haarooxxa Hedhio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Yoonna ha'no Kiristoosinni welti reyotenaa'ni kexxineexxenni Kirisitoosi iima Mageniinke midda'ni ofo'leexxi hedheeba hexxeexxa yaanuwwa halse! <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Duuchchi wodda ookkoo iima hexxeexxa yaanuwwa hedde malee kaba butta hexxeexxa yaanuwwa heddinoqqe'e! <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Ha'no rertine'eenn hedho ha'nooxxinna Magenoke'n Kiristoosinni sho'onde'een. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Hedho ha'nooxxe kadeeke Kiristoosi leellaa wodda ha'noonna isinni welti ulfinnik leellitinaan.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dullate Hedhonna Haarooxxa Hedho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Tennexxee ha'noo'ni afeendaaxxa buttixxe hedhoxxa halcha duuchcha shiwwe! Tinni halchaaranna Yabaabulle, batto'a, qii'misa, fuggoxxa halchanna, dharichcha magenuwwa magenoonfata kaddeexxe illimoollummaaran. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Iitta hexxeexxe yaannuwwanaa'ni kexxeexxa Mageniinxi mufe ajajemabaake manna'ni daggaan. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Ha'noonna ha'nooke umininni konneechchi edi darre iitta hexxeexxe yaannuwwa giddo hexxinemman.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Ta'a kinni ha'no mufe, hifo, shokko, summa balleessanna shookishaaka haaso'a ha'nooke afo'onaa'ni fuggusse'e! <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Dullatte manjunte isixxe hujenninni fulchexxineexxi hundineemmaxxee'e weli'anni weli dhara haasottinoqqe'e! <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />Isoo dadeekixxe fakke kaddo'a ege'nati harro'mita'n me'itaaxxa eettene haarooxxa manjunte oddo'we. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Konne qicinni Girkeeke yookaan Ayihudake, jila ofo'leeke yookaan jila ofo'lebaake, alagake yookaan Isikuteesite, garbake yookaan goottake hiyyatixxi gargarumma hexxeba'a. Yaane kinni Kiristoosi duuchchiingenna duuchchinge'niten.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Yoona ha'noo Mageni fi'leekenna woyyoole, eeyyendineeke kaddinemma qicinni maraarte, arjunte, shaqunte, sigguntenna ossunte oddo'we! <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Weli'anni weli dande'we! Manji mitti weleke'ni quuqemeexxe kaddoole weli weli'a gattowwaal hiyye! Gootti Yessuusi ha'no'a gattowwaali hiyyemmashshanni ha'noonna welekee gattowwaali hiyye! <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Tenne duuchchi iimi darre duuchchiinxe yaane'a wo'ma mittumma iyyedaggaxxa jaalala oddo'we! <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Mitte manjunteke biso kaddineemmaxxee ye'endinnechchi konne nage'i'aate kadeemmaxxee Kiristoosik nage'i qalbe ha'nooxxe moyowwaal; galatefattinaakenna kadde. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Kiristoosik hiyyichchi wo'ma qico'ni ha'noo'ni hedhowwaal! Mitti mitte beekkumi duuchchinni barachchiisina'ni weli gorse! Faaroti saadinot, hafuuriinke meellinni Mageno qalbeti galateefattina'ni faarse. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Kirsitoosi gamii'ni Mageno Aabi'i galateeffatina'ni haaso'ikinna kaddo'o, hujetinna, assitinaaxxa yaane duuchcha Gootti Yessuusike summinni asse.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammaanyetike Mini Hadixxa Hedho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Ha'no aruwwaa! Gootti edo hasissaaxxe yaane kaddeemmaxxee ha'nooke aro'uwwi'aa ajajemme!<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Ha'no aro'uwwii! Ha'nooxxa aruwwa eeyye! Hedho insa'nexxanna qaraarstinoqqe'e.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Ha'no oose! Tinni Gootta gammachchissaaxxe kaddeemmaxxee duuchchiinxe yaanenni hado ha'nookee ajajemme!<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Ha'noo oosetiki hadi! Oose ha'nooxxi godoba kultitabaashsha insa'nee hifachchiissinoqqe'e.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Ha'no garbi! Buttatike ha'nookee goottuwwi'a duuchchiinxe yaanenni ajajemme! Ajajendinaa qicinna insa'ne ha'no undammaxxenna manjo gammachchisatee leella calli'aate kadebaak Gootta Yessuusii sodaatati qajeelto qalbennite kaddowwaali. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Hujjinaaxxa yaane duuchcha manjokeete kaddebaak Goottake hujjina'neeshsha qalbeti hujje! <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Tennexxee Gootti iimika qadaada ha'no'a uwwaaxxa egendineen; ergatendina'neekinna Gootta Kiristoosi'aten. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Balleessaakinna eettenne balleesseemmaxxe mura woxaan.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Ha'no goottuwwi! Ha'no'anna iima Gootti hedheexxa egendineeni; tennexxee ha'nooka erganjuwwa qullumatinna seerik galche!<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lebemeeka Wele Gorsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Jabaattine Mageno galateefattina'ni duuchchi wodda soodatte. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Tennenni welt Mageni konne hiyyichcho isike'e no'o'a ora banaashsha, iittanni isixxe buutonni usuremmeennekee, Kiristoosixxa buqo yaane lallaba dandeenannoshsha no'o'a soodatte. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Ani hasissaa qico'ni hiyyichcho isika ifise haaso'annoshsha soodatte.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Heenenna dagattaaxxe yanna la'offatina'n amanabaake manni giddo beekkumik hedhdhe. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Mitte mitte manji'a hasisaaka hiissichcho hiissa egendinaashsha haaso'i ha'nook duuchchi wodda elaakenna xe'make kadowwaali.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muxaaminka Naga'a Dhaamaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Eeyyemeeki no'oki dayyi aninni welti Goottiinxe huje'ni mitteba hedheekinna eeyyemeek, addatemeek erganjinna Tikiqoosi anxee duuchchiinxa yaane ha'noo'ni kulaan. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Isoo ha'noobaa ergeennelchchi no'o he'nenneka jeeja ha'noo'ni kulaashshanna qalbe ha'nooxxa dayyeessaashshaten. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Isinni weltinna addatemeekinna eeyyemeek jaalo ha'nooke kadeeki dayyi Onesimoosi ha'noobaa dagaan; insa'ne kaba hexxeexxa yaane duuchcha ha'noo'ni kullaan.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aninni welti usuremeek Arsixirokoosi nage'a ha'no'a dhaameeni; Bernabaasike dayyiki belti Maariqoosi nage'a ha'no'a dhameeen; ha'nobaa dagaa wodda isoo adhdhitinaashsha konneechchi edi darre erga ha'noobaa gelteeni. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Iyyosixxoosi hiyyemaak Iyyaasunna nage'a ha'noo'a dhameen; moottuma Mageniinxee aninni welti huja'neeke mann giddii'ni Ayihuudake kadeeki insa'ne callaan; insa'nenna anee dayyeessineen. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Yessuusi Kiristoosike erganjo kade'eek Ephaafira ha'nook nage'a ha'no'aa dhaame'een; hafuuriinxe hedhonni nophphati ti'ni hitinee uurritinaashshanna fedhii Mageniinxa duuchcha egendinaashsha isi duuchchini wodda ha'no'a soodata'neen. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Ha'nooxxee Ephafira, iittanni Lodoqiyake'ninna Iyyaraake qachcha'ni hedheeke manni'a lumo qico elo'a'neexxa aninni isi'a dhugaa kulaannon. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Eeyyemeeki ci'leesichchi Luqqaasinna Deemaasi ha'no'a nage'a dhaammeeni.<verse eid="COL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Lodoqiya hedheeke dayuuwwi'a, Nimifu'aanna iseke mine'n hexxeexxe Mageniinxe tuutaa nage'a ani'a kulle. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Tenne Ergendeexxa borro ha'no haasesitineechchi uduma Lodoqiyaxxe tuuta'aanna haasseessendaashsha asse; ha'noonna Lodooqiyyake dayyuwwanaa'ni ha'no'a ergendaaxxa erga haasseesse. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Arkiphaasi'ninna «Goottakenaa'n adhdhitettexxa ergatensha muuxxattoshsha jabaati!» hitineexxi ani'a iso'n kulle.<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Konne nage'a anxe anganni borreesenek ante Phawuloositen; usuremee hedhennexxanna deetinoqqe'e!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Badhaadhi Mageniinki ha'noonni welti hedhowwaal.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>